<title>POLAND: PAGED OCT NET JUMPS TO PLN 2.23 MLN.</title>
<headline>PAGED OCT NET JUMPS TO PLN 2.23 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.23 vs   0.61</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.02 vs   0.98</p>
